      "lineRange": [12, 81],
      "summary": "可扩容的字节缓冲写入器，按大端写出 8/16/32/64 位整数与 float64，并强制 maxByteLength。",
      "tags": ["cbor", "encoder", "buffer", "writer"],
      "complexity": "moderate"
    },
    {
      "id": "function:packages/protocol/src/cbor/encoder.ts:ensureCapacity",
